# Fixture: one training attempt interrupted by a node drain -- the case this repo
# exists to show, and the only case where sigterm/drain_done exist at all. Shape is
# a real pod stdout: PHASE lines interleaved with ordinary log lines, second
# resolution ts per the contract, plus a tokenizer-stage triple so the renderer's
# stage filter is under test.
#
# `first_step` and `ckpt_saved` are in the contract but the landed entrypoint does
# NOT emit them -- both happen inside torchrun, which bash only wraps. They are
# here because the contract is the interface, and `timeline.sh --check` renders
# this same file with those two stripped to prove the degraded path.
